flowchart LR
    Spec[OpenAPI / Swagger] --> Parser[Go parser]
    Parser --> Graph[(Scoped Memgraph inventory)]
    Gateway[Gateway logs] --> Kafka[Kafka]
    Kafka --> Consumer[Go consumer]
    Graph --> Context[Versioned inventory context]
    Context --> Consumer
    Redis[(Optional Redis snapshots)] <--> Consumer
    Consumer --> Detector[Python inventory rules + behavioral detector]
    Detector --> Store[(SQLite traffic + predictions)]
    Consumer --> Store
    Store --> Candidates[Passive shadow candidates]
    Graph --> Planner[Production probe planner]
    Candidates --> Planner
    Planner --> Verifier[Active response + schema + authentication verification]
    Verifier --> Findings[(Persisted findings + scan history)]
    Store --> Dashboard[Dashboard API]
    Findings --> Dashboard
    Dashboard --> Browser[Real browser interface]
